                  "name": "The Nike Everyday Plus Cushioned Socks bring comfort to your workout with extra cushioning under the heel and forefoot and a snug, supportive arch band. Sweat-wicking power and breathability up top help keep your feet dry and cool to help push you through that extra set. Shown: Multi-Color Style: SX6897-965",
