                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The Nike Everyday Plus Cushioned Socks bring comfort to your workout with extra cushioning under the heel and forefoot and a snug, supportive arch band. Sweat-wicking power and breathability up top help keep your feet dry and cool to help push you through that extra set.\n\nShown: Multi-Color\nStyle: SX6897-965",
